{"ts":"2026-08-10T23:30:51.145Z","author":"harness:claude-code","author_source":"asserted","agent_harness":"claude-code","agent_instance":"1afd4367fbbff62fc92ece2d","agent_provenance":{"model":null,"effort":{"value":"xhigh","source":"environment"},"role":{"value":"implementer","source":"argv"},"topic":null},"op":"create","patch":[{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/id","value":"pm-rl-o9dr"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/title","value":"isEnvironmentInvalidated reports an edit for an environment that is absent, and the fence regex is duplicated five times"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/description","value":"CodeRabbit review of pm-rl#12, Minor plus Trivial.\n\nisEnvironmentInvalidated returns a boolean true for four distinct conditions - missing affected_version, missing fence, hash mismatch, and any thrown error from getTypedItem - and buildLineageAncestry renders one fixed reason, environment was edited, for all four. A test registers a generation whose environment_version resolves to nothing and asserts the row reads environment was edited. The environment was never edited; it is absent. The operator is given a wrong diagnosis of a provenance failure. LineageRow.invalidated is already typed string-or-null, so return the reason rather than a boolean.\n\nSeparately the specification fence regex is written out five times in index.ts, so every copy must change together. Define it once.\n\nConfirmed while reviewing: the OpenGrep command-injection.exec-js findings on those lines are FALSE POSITIVES - each call is RegExp.prototype.exec, not child_process.exec."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/type","value":"Issue"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/status","value":"open"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/priority","value":3},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/tags","value":[]},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/created_at","value":"2026-08-10T23:30:51.145Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-08-10T23:30:51.145Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/author","value":"harness:claude-code"}],"before_hash":"3cc22dff72be7b14824654a7a64ea62b04799939b2fee54c1b5f52ca60bf6df0","after_hash":"26b9902ee985afae132b97278a0add5e8ec9c73eb1ada73ea48bf448519b4d26","message":"","context":{"agent_provenance_outcomes":{"model":{"status":"failed","reason":"resolver_failed","resolver":"claude_session_file","rule_version":"v1"},"version":{"status":"failed","reason":"resolver_failed","resolver":"claude_session_file","rule_version":"v1"}}}}
